OL,3,CHalf of England in drought: The crisis
OL,4,Cin pictures
OL,6,FRecord low rainfall and soaring
OL,7,Ftemperatures have left seven areas of
OL,8,Fcentral, eastern and southern England
OL,9,Fofficially in drought.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency (EA) has said
OL,12,Fthat seven regions ` covering large
OL,13,Fparts of central, eastern and southern
OL,14,FEngland ` are now in official drought
OL,15,Fconditions.
OL,17,FIt added that the impacts are already
OL,18,Fbeing felt, including low river flows,
OL,19,Fearly harvests and high risk of
OL,20,Fwildfires. More than 20 million people
OL,21,Fare already under hosepipe bans.
