OL,3,CHalf of England in drought: The crisis
OL,4,Cin pictures
OL,6,FIt is the second consecutive year that
OL,7,Fparts of England have entered drought,
OL,8,Fdespite wet winter weather
OL,9,Freplenishing reservoirs and
OL,10,Fgroundwater and helping the country
OL,11,Favoid major impacts during a dry
OL,12,Fspring.
OL,14,FHere is what it looks like across the
OL,15,Fcountry:
